{
  "_about": "UZH in frooms (worker/uzh.ts, worker/uzhspaces.ts, scripts/uzh_catalogue.py, scripts/make_map.py). campuses: our areas and the 3V-Rooms calendar filter of each. exclude: room titles (case-insensitive) that aren't teaching rooms. room_types: typecode by 3V resource id where the seat rule (lecture hall from lecture_hall_min_seats seats, else seminar room) is wrong. libraries_url: the University Library's location list (hours, buildings, seats, closures); library_campuses: its campus names -> our areas (other locations are left out). sensors: the library's seat sensors (occupancy_url?id=N) -> the location (bib id) they count, and a name where one location has several. map_buildings: buildings drawn as part of another on the map (one outline in OpenStreetMap), whose rooms and libraries count there. library_notes: the note for a location open by card only, where it isn't 'UZH members only' (the UB's page says who gets in). mensas: UZH's mensas, whose menus come from ZFV's food2050 pages (worker/uzhmenus.ts): id (ours, UM<n>), facility (a menu_days key far above Cookpit's ids), name, area, building (on that campus's map; MEN is the Mensa building at Künstlergasse 10), floor, site and outlet (food2050's slugs: app.food2050.ch/en/zfv/universitat-zurich,<site>/<outlet>), meals (food2050's slug of each meal, and its time from zfv.ch, else from famoser/Mensa), hours (Monday to Friday, from zfv.ch's regular semester hours; a day without dishes is closed). Between their meals (and before the first) an open UZH mensa is a study space, also Seerose and Insieme (CHOICES.md), so there is no cafe_outside_meals here. cafes: cafeterias and bars without menus on food2050: id (UC<n>), name, area, building, floor, hours (Monday to Friday, from zfv.ch, kept by hand) and url (their zfv.ch page). A building without an outline in OpenStreetMap (Y05) is label only (data/map/campuses.json not_on_map) and placed by static/map/pins.json.",
